      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file that uses a concrete external provider for email and password login. I will use the Firebase Authentication service, which is a well-known provider for handling user authentication. The Firebase Admin SDK will be used to interact with the Firebase Authentication service. </thinking>\n",
