      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a Python script that registers a new user with an email and password using a concrete external provider. I will use the Firebase Authentication service for this task, as it is a well-known and widely used service for user authentication. The script will include the Firebase Admin SDK, which is the official Python library for interacting with Firebase services. </thinking>\n",
